<title>CHINA: China January zinc exports up 100.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China January zinc exports up 100.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys reached 30,914 tonnes in January, up 100.3 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China exported a total of 226,777 tonnes of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys in 1996, up 18.4 percent compared with 1995, customs figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
